## 2. Typeface Roboto

- **Work:** Roboto
- **Author:** Google LLC
- **Source:** https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Roboto
- **Licence:** Apache License 2.0
  (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)
- **Usage:** not redistributed with this project. It is requested at runtime
  from Google Fonts, which serves it under the same licence. If the request
  fails, the app falls back to system fonts.
- **Files:** none in this repository.

## 3. Material Design 3 colour tokens

- **Work:** Material Design 3 design system, colour roles and elevation values
- **Author:** Google LLC
- **Source:** https://m3.material.io/
- **Licence:** Apache License 2.0
  (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)
- **Usage:** colour role names and palette values were transcribed into CSS
  custom properties in `styles.css`. No Material code or component library is
  bundled.

## 4. Nothing else

No other third-party content is included. There are no audio files, no
analytics, no icon fonts and no JavaScript libraries. Sound effects are
generated at runtime by the Web Audio API inside `app.js`.
